				Time="2011-11-24T03:08:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]王子『何だとー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:08:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
